David chot 27/08: bi danh tai san goc cua A1 la LOVE9, va TUYET DOI KHONG dang ky them AVAX
tro cung assetID. Da can nhac phuong an dang ky hai bi danh (ids.Aliaser cho phep, va
PrimaryAlias van tra LOVE9 vi no dang ky truoc) — BI LOAI. Chu quyen o lop may DOC, khong chi
lop nguoi NHIN.

Luot nay KHONG lam AVAX chay duoc. No chi lam viec *khong chay* noi ra ly do.

VI SAO CAN: chinh A1 mat nua ngay vi cau `asset 'AVAX' not found` tran trui (D-082) — va A1
co ca DECISIONS.md de tra. Nguoi ngoai gap dung cau do khong co gi ca. Da chon mot duong lam
cong cu ben thu ba hong, thi cai gia toi thieu la hong RA TIENG.

Cau loi viet bang tieng Anh, CO Y: nguoi doc no la lap trinh vien ben thu ba, khong phai
nguoi dung trang tieng Viet.

PHAM VI: cham vms/avm — goi ma rebrand.sh khai "tuyet doi khong cham". Day la mot nhanh trong
ham TRA TEN, khong dung dong thuan, khong dung trang thai, khong dung byte genesis. Neu David
thay lan ranh do khong nen co ngoai le thi go dung commit nay ra, phan con lai khong phu thuoc.

NGHIEM THU — 6 ca, trong do BA CA DOI CHUNG moi la phan dang gia:
  A1 that + AVAX          -> co giai thich
  A1 tap  + AVAX          -> co giai thich
  A1      + ten khac      -> loi TRAN   (loi giai thich khong duoc vai ra moi loi tra ten)
  UnitTest + AVAX         -> loi TRAN   (nhanh theo BANG, khong theo chuoi)
  mainnet  + AVAX         -> loi TRAN
  A1      + ten co that   -> van tra duoc (nhanh them vao khong chan duong song)
Toan bo goi vms/avm: xanh, 0 FAIL.

⚠️ Cau loi nay chi den tay nguoi dung khi dung lai image node — luot build ngay G.

